{
	"title": "Trouver la fraction égale",
	"description": "Parmi quatre, la fraction égale à 3/4 (leurres : même nombre ajouté en haut et en bas, dénominateur seul multiplié)",
	"grades": ["CE2"],
	"theme": "Fractions",
	"domain": "Apprivoiser",
	"subdomain": "Egalité de fractions",
	"level": 8,
	"delay": 30,
	"status": "draft",
	"options": {
		"constraints": {
			"reducedFractions": "off"
		}
	},
	"variations": [
		{
			"statement": "Quelle fraction est égale à $\\frac{{{a}}}{{{d}}}$ ?\n\n```choix\n- $$\\frac{{{eval:a*k}}}{{{eval:d*k}}}$$\n- $$\\frac{{{eval:a+k}}}{{{eval:d+k}}}$$\n- $$\\frac{{{a}}}{{{eval:d*k}}}$$\n- $$\\frac{{{eval:a+1}}}{{{eval:d+1}}}$$\n```",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "d",
					"expression": "2..6"
				},
				{
					"name": "k",
					"expression": "2..6"
				},
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "1..{{eval:d-1}}"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["d*k <= 12"],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "0"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"On ne change pas une fraction quand on multiplie (ou qu'on divise) son numérateur **et** son dénominateur par le même nombre.",
					"$$\\frac{{{a}}}{{{d}}} = \\frac{{{a}} \\times {{k}}}{{{d}} \\times {{k}}} = \\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{\\frac{{{eval:a*k}}}{{{eval:d*k}}}}$$",
					"Ajouter le même nombre en haut et en bas ne donne pas une fraction égale."
				]
			}
		}
	],
	"testSpecs": [
		{
			"description": "3/4 : 6/8",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"d": "4",
				"k": "2",
				"a": "3"
			},
			"answers": ["0"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "correct"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "Erreur : 3/4, 5/6 (2 ajouté en haut et en bas)",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"d": "4",
				"k": "2",
				"a": "3"
			},
			"answers": ["1"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "incorrect"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "Erreur : 3/4, 3/8 (dénominateur seul multiplié)",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"d": "4",
				"k": "2",
				"a": "3"
			},
			"answers": ["2"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "incorrect"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "Erreur : 3/4, 4/5 (1 ajouté en haut et en bas)",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"d": "4",
				"k": "2",
				"a": "3"
			},
			"answers": ["3"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "incorrect"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "BO : 1/2, 3/6",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"d": "2",
				"k": "3",
				"a": "1"
			},
			"answers": ["0"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "correct"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "borne : 5/6, 10/12",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"d": "6",
				"k": "2",
				"a": "5"
			},
			"answers": ["0"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "correct"
			}
		}
	]
}
